    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about finding \"small things\" though. there's nothing left to find. if the person who actually lived, who actually felt alive, is dead... then what's the point of dragging this body around? it feels more like a prison than a life. it feels like i'm just haunting my own existence.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
